(3) For the purposes of calculating the weekly income of an applicant, where the period in respect of which payment is made exceeds a week, the amount to be included in the applicant’s weekly income is to be determined:

in a case where that period is a month, by multiplying the amount of the payment by 12 and dividing the product by 52;

